@startuml "activity_export_appointments"
skinparam ConditionEndStyle hline
title "[Activity] Export Scheduled Appointments"
|Site Coordinator|
start
:<b>Site Coordinator Inputs:</b>
* Desired Day;
:Requests appointments for that day.;
note right
**API Request**
GET /appointment
<font:monospaced>
query
date=12741201
end note

|System|
:Get appointments that land on the given day.;

if (Is there any appointments) then (No)
    |Site Coordinator|
    :Alert user no\nappointments.;
    stop
else (Yes)
endif

|System|
partition "Compile list of appointments" {
    floating note right
        <font:monospaced>
        appointments = [
            {
                "date_time": 
                    21321312,
                "full_name": 
                    "Jane Doe",
                "phone_number": 
                    "1234567890",
                "zip_code":
                    12345
            }
        ]
    end note

    while (db_appointments) is (not empty)
        :Add to appointments;
    endwhile (empty)
}

:Return list of appointments;

|Site Coordinator|
:Retrive list of appointments;
:Display list of appointments;
:Open print dialog to\nprint appointment list;
end
@enduml